<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY STAT. OFFICE RELEASES FEB PPI DETAILS.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY STAT. OFFICE RELEASES FEB PPI DETAILS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistical Office</p>
<p>(KSH) on Wednesday released detailed producer price index (PPI)</p>
<p>fihures for February.</p>
<p>HUNGARY PPI CHANGE IN DOMESTIC SALES</p>
<p>							   Mth/mth  Yr/yr</p>
<p> Mining						    2.4     21.7</p>
<p> Processing industry				   2.2     20.7</p>
<p>  - Food, drinks, tobacco products		 2.6     27.3</p>
<p>  - Textile, clothing, leather products	  1.8     17.2</p>
<p>  - Wood, paper, printing industry products    2.3     11.5</p>
<p>  - Chemicals industry				-0.6     24.7</p>
<p>  - Non-metal mineral products		     6.1     20.6</p>
<p>  - Metallurgy, metal processing		   2.1     10.7</p>
<p>  - Machinery industry				 4.6     12.7</p>
<p>  - Other processing industry			1.1     16.1</p>
<p> Electricity-, gas-, heat- and water supply    2.6     42.7</p>
<p> Total industry					  2.3     24.7</p>
<p>HUNGARY PPI CHANGE IN EXPORT SALES (PCT)</p>
<p>							   Mth/mth  Yr/yr</p>
<p> Mining						    1.1     12.0</p>
<p> Processing industry				   1.7     18.1</p>
<p>  - Food, drinks, tobacco products		 2.7     29.8</p>
<p>  - Textile, clothing, leather products	  1.7     17.0</p>
<p>  - Wood, paper, printing industry products    0.8	9.4</p>
<p>  - Chemicals industry				 3.3     28.0</p>
<p>  - Non-metal mineral products		     2.7     22.8</p>
<p>  - Metallurgy, metal processing		  -0.3	8.1</p>
<p>  - Machinery industry				 1.2     12.5</p>
<p>  - Other processing industry			1.6     13.5</p>
<p> Electricity-, gas-, heat- and water supply    -	  -</p>
<p> Total industry					  1.7     18.1</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
